  "comment": [
    "The same model as model.sysml, written the way the Flexo MMS SysML v2 service's own",
    "commit path takes it: SysML v2 JSON changes with standard metamodel properties only.",
    "Posting this and reading it back establishes what that read path can carry, which is",
    "the ground truth the Turtle load is measured against. Element ids repeat the ids",
    "OpenSysML encodes, except that expression nodes are named with '_' where OpenSysML",
    "writes '.', because the service's requireValidId rejects a dot.",
    "The 'comment' key is documentation for a reader; the harness posts only 'change'."
  ],
